<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67386" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήλῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Aeol.
		, 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλινος</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλον</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of an
				apple-tree</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὔσδων μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>made of apples</i> or <i>quinces</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Od.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of a quince-yellow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.18.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθῆτες, καρυωτοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12.539e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.53
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.137
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτῶνα μάλινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					462
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				34
			</span></i> (Tanagra, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
